WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:14.743
A person in black shirt and blue gloves tends to plants inside a white panel on a spacecraft wall. The person then places a red chili pepper on a dark panel beside a yellow card reading "VEGGIE KEEP SAMPLE", while two other astronauts watch and clap.

2
00:01:24.124 --> 00:01:39.879
Two men stand inside a spacecraft module. A green-shirted person and a black-shirted person with a transparent bag enter from opposite sides. The group gathers around equipment, the blue-shirted man holding a yellow object while others gesture at panels.
